  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 74,
        "endIndex": 459,
        "text": "### [0] OpenAI claims solution to Navier–Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\n* **Candidate:** [0]\n* **What is confirmed:** On September 8, 2026, OpenAI published a paper and formal Lean proof claiming that an unreleased internal AI system (utilizing ~10,000 autonomous agents over 88 hours) demonstrated a finite-time blowup/singularity in the 3D incompressible Navier–Stokes equations"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 461,
        "endIndex": 593,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** The 160+ page proof has been formalized in Lean but remains unverified by the broader mathematics community"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 595,
        "endIndex": 823,
        "text": "The claim is accompanied by public controversy: NYU mathematician Tristan Buckmaster and Anthropic researcher Levent Alpöge raised concerns that OpenAI's system may have benefited from their unpublished research via Codex usage"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 825,
        "endIndex": 879,
        "text": "OpenAI denied accessing unpublished data or user files"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 925,
        "endIndex": 1028,
        "text": "** Major technological and scientific milestone, with widespread coverage across science and tech media"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        5,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1036,
        "endIndex": 1334,
        "text": "### [1] Google DeepMind releases AlphaGenome Atlas\n* **Candidate:** [1]\n* **What is confirmed:** Google DeepMind launched AlphaGenome Atlas, a free, 1-petabyte database providing precomputed molecular effect predictions for all ~9 billion possible single-nucleotide DNA variants in the human genome"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1336,
        "endIndex": 1465,
        "text": "It introduces the AlphaGenome Variant Impact (AVI) score to help researchers prioritize variants across coding and non-coding DNA"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1467,
        "endIndex": 1736,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Predictions are generated *in silico* by DeepMind's underlying AlphaGenome model and require downstream laboratory/clinical validation, though early collaborations with the Broad Institute and UK Biobank demonstrated positive diagnostic utility"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1782,
        "endIndex": 1854,
        "text": "** Significant release in AI applied to biological research and medicine"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1862,
        "endIndex": 2152,
        "text": "### [2] Suno rolls out v6 AI music models trained with WMG and BMG\n* **Candidate:** [2]\n* **What is confirmed:** Suno officially launched its v6 series of AI music models (including v6, v6-wild, and v6-mini), trained under licensed catalog partnerships with Warner Music Group (WMG) and BMG"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2154,
        "endIndex": 2308,
        "text": "Suno will pay royalties to publishers/labels when their music and opt-in artist catalogs are utilized, and prompting won't allow unlicensed artist cloning"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2310,
        "endIndex": 2480,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Features such as audio downloads and full commercial usage rights are restricted to paid subscription tiers, and legacy models will be phased out"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        12,
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2526,
        "endIndex": 2603,
        "text": "** Major commercial milestone in generative AI music and copyright resolution"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2611,
        "endIndex": 2919,
        "text": "### [3] Meta debuts personal AI agent \"Muse\"\n* **Candidate:** [3]\n* **What is confirmed:** Meta released \"Muse,\" a personal AI agent designed to execute multi-step real-world tasks (filling forms, managing calendars, booking travel, and tracking long-term goals) via a standalone app and WhatsApp integration"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2921,
        "endIndex": 3000,
        "text": "Meta launched paid subscription tiers ($20 to $100/month) alongside a free tier"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3002,
        "endIndex": 3072,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Available initially only to US users aged 18+"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        17,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3074,
        "endIndex": 3243,
        "text": "To mitigate prompt injection and data exposure risks when taking autonomous web actions, Meta runs each user session inside a dedicated virtual machine (VM) in its cloud"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3289,
        "endIndex": 3353,
        "text": "** Significant product release in the personal AI agent category"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        19,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3361,
        "endIndex": 3672,
        "text": "### [6] Terence Tao warns of AI \"non-renewably mining\" open math problems\n* **Candidate:** [6]\n* **What is confirmed:** Fields Medalist Terence Tao posted on Mathstodon warning that autonomous AI systems deployed at scale threaten to \"flatten\" open research problems as soon as rumors of active research surface"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3674,
        "endIndex": 3797,
        "text": "He cautioned this dynamic could incentivize researchers to stop sharing work openly, undermining open scientific traditions"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3799,
        "endIndex": 3982,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Tao's statement represents expert commentary on academic incentives and AI methodology rather than a corporate product announcement or technical paper release"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4095,
        "endIndex": 4339,
        "text": "### [7] Google announces €13B+ AI infrastructure investment in Finland\n* **Candidate:** [7]\n* **What is confirmed:** Google announced plans to invest at least €13 billion ($15.1 billion) over 2027–2028 in Finnish digital/AI infrastructure"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4341,
        "endIndex": 4594,
        "text": "The expansion includes constructing three new data center sites in Kajaani, Muhos, and Vaala, expanding its Hamina facility, and securing a 22-year nuclear power purchase agreement (PPA) with Fortum to extend the Loviisa nuclear plant's operational life"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22,
        23,
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4596,
        "endIndex": 4751,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Capital expenditure spans a multi-year construction window (2027–2028) and remains subject to regional grid connection schedules"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
